Generic single-database configuration.

Set DATABASE_URL in .env to a MySQL 8 connection using the PyMySQL driver and
utf8mb4, then run:

    python -m alembic upgrade head

The migration chain creates the normalized application schema, adds and seeds
learning resources and starter career data, then adds a student-profile index,
analysis-result fields, and hashed refresh-token sessions. The migrations
preserve existing user/profile/CV data and do not create an Admin account. See
the repository README for the secure Admin bootstrap command.